      "slug": "the-long-phone-call",
      "title": "The Long Phone Call",
      "subtitle": "Three hours that felt like twenty minutes",
      "event_date": "2019-12-02",
      "date_label": null,
      "chapter": "Beginnings",
      "description": "Neither of us wanted to be the one to hang up, so we just… didn't. You fell asleep mid-sentence. I stayed on the line a while longer, listening, feeling ridiculous and completely certain at the same time.",
