      "title": "The Kitchen Disaster",
      "subtitle": "We do not talk about the risotto",
      "event_date": "2020-03-14",
      "date_label": null,
      "chapter": "Learning Each Other",
      "description": "It was supposed to be simple. It was not simple. We ate cereal at 11pm on the kitchen floor and you said it was the best meal you'd had all year, and the worst part is I think you meant it.",
